#!/bin/bash -l
# Corrected matched comparison: ordinary K=4 and selected K=4 come from the
# existing decoder-only K=8 control pool; joint repulsion uses the existing
# alpha=0.20 K=4 run with matching non-repulsion sampler settings.
# No posterior samples are generated by this GPU-allocated analysis job.
#SBATCH --time=02:00:00
#SBATCH -C gpu
#SBATCH --account=m5021_g
#SBATCH --qos=shared
#SBATCH --ntasks=1
#SBATCH --cpus-per-task=32
#SBATCH --gpus-per-task=1
#SBATCH --array=0-2%3
#SBATCH -J SR_postMatch
#SBATCH --output=/global/cfs/cdirs/m5021/sjdas/era5_videogen/logs/sr_repulsion/%x_%A_%a.out
#SBATCH --error=/global/cfs/cdirs/m5021/sjdas/era5_videogen/logs/sr_repulsion/%x_%A_%a.err

set -euo pipefail

module load conda
conda activate "${CONDA_ENV_NAME:-era5_env}"

REPO_DIR="${ERA5_VIDEOGEN_REPO_DIR:-/global/cfs/cdirs/m5021/sjdas/era5_videogen}"
cd "${REPO_DIR}"

export OMP_NUM_THREADS="${SLURM_CPUS_PER_TASK}"
export MKL_NUM_THREADS="${SLURM_CPUS_PER_TASK}"
export OPENBLAS_NUM_THREADS="${SLURM_CPUS_PER_TASK}"
export PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1
export MPLCONFIGDIR="${TMPDIR:-/tmp}/era5-matplotlib-${SLURM_JOB_ID}"
mkdir -p "${MPLCONFIGDIR}"
unset SLURM_MEM_PER_CPU SLURM_MEM_PER_GPU SLURM_MEM_PER_NODE

WINDOWS=(0 3 7)
TASK_ID="${SLURM_ARRAY_TASK_ID:-0}"
if (( TASK_ID < 0 || TASK_ID >= ${#WINDOWS[@]} )); then
  echo "ERROR: array task ${TASK_ID} is outside 0..$((${#WINDOWS[@]} - 1))" >&2
  exit 2
fi
WINDOW_INDEX="${WINDOWS[${TASK_ID}]}"

bash scripts/check_main8_assets.sh data
mapfile -t LATENT_FILES < <(
  find data/latents/test -maxdepth 1 -type f -name '*.h5' -printf '%f\n' | sort
)
SOURCE_FILE="${LATENT_FILES[${WINDOW_INDEX}]}"
SOURCE_INDEX="${SOURCE_FILE#2020_}"
SOURCE_INDEX="${SOURCE_INDEX%.h5}"

FULL_K8_SUMMARY="outputs/metrics/repulsion_full_k8/w$(printf '%02d' "${WINDOW_INDEX}")_alpha0p20/summary.json"
JOINT_RUN="outputs/sr/repulsion_smoke_k4/w$(printf '%02d' "${WINDOW_INDEX}")_src${SOURCE_INDEX}_alpha0p20_seed17"
JOINT_SAMPLE="${JOINT_RUN}/sample_$(printf '%04d' "${WINDOW_INDEX}")/samples.npy"
if [[ ! -s "${FULL_K8_SUMMARY}" ]]; then
  echo "ERROR: missing completed full-K8 metric summary: ${FULL_K8_SUMMARY}" >&2
  exit 2
fi
if [[ ! -s "${JOINT_SAMPLE}" || ! -s "${JOINT_RUN}/metadata.json" ]]; then
  echo "ERROR: missing existing alpha=0.20 K=4 joint run: ${JOINT_RUN}" >&2
  exit 2
fi

OUTPUT_DIR="outputs/metrics/posthoc_matched_comparison_k4/w$(printf '%02d' "${WINDOW_INDEX}")"
echo "Window:                  ${WINDOW_INDEX} (source ${SOURCE_INDEX})"
echo "Matched K=8 source:      ${FULL_K8_SUMMARY}"
echo "Reference ensemble:      first 4 matched-control particles"
echo "Post-hoc candidates:     all 8 matched-control particles"
echo "Joint repulsion:         ${JOINT_RUN}"
echo "Output:                  ${OUTPUT_DIR}"
nvidia-smi --query-gpu=name,memory.total --format=csv,noheader

python scripts/evaluate_posthoc_matched_comparison_k4.py \
  --full-k8-summary "${FULL_K8_SUMMARY}" \
  --joint-repulsion-run "${JOINT_RUN}" \
  --data-root data \
  --window "${WINDOW_INDEX}" \
  --selection-spatial-pool 8 \
  --expected-repulsion-strength 0.20 \
  --output-dir "${OUTPUT_DIR}"

echo "Matched post-hoc comparison completed for window ${WINDOW_INDEX}."
echo "Summary: ${REPO_DIR}/${OUTPUT_DIR}/summary.json"
